The second planted set: each behaviour the first set masked, planted alone where its arm reaches it.
Planted: the reader's browser test, relay read and own thread; the failed reading's log line; seeing the notice;
the readings' stop when the last tab leaves; the script's usage listener; the update page's caption.
TestDefaults' InProcessHang is 1 min and BrowserHang 2 min in this build only, so a planted wait ends sooner.
